<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Limpiador de Documentos</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0b0f0d;
      --panel:#121815;
      --card:#161d19;
      --olive:#7b8d4a;
      --olive-light:#a4b86a;
      --olive-soft:#2a3326;
      --text:#e8efe6;
      --muted:#aab6a1;
      --shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    body{
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #0f1412 0%, #0b0f0d 55%);
      color:var(--text);
      min-height:100vh;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      padding:30px 16px;
    }
    .wrapper{width:100%;max-width:980px;}
    header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:28px;}
    header h1{font-size:2.3rem;color:var(--olive-light);letter-spacing:1px;}
    header p{margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;}
    .panel{
      background:var(--panel);
      border-radius:22px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      padding:28px;
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap:22px;
      border:1px solid #1e2621;
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }
    .panel::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      top:-80px;right:-60px;
      width:220px;height:220px;
      background:rgba(123,141,74,0.12);
      border-radius:50%;
    }
    .card{border-radius:18px;padding:24px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid #243027;}
    .upload-title{font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--olive-light);font-weight:bold;}
    .upload-sub{font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;}
    input[type="file"]{display:none;}
    .btn{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
      padding:12px 20px;border-radius:14px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--olive) 0%, #8ea35a 100%);
      color:#0d120f;font-weight:bold;border:none;cursor:pointer;
      box-shadow:0 10px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }
    .btn-secondary{background:#1f2822;color:var(--olive-light);border:1px solid #3b4a3c;box-shadow:none;}
    .status{margin-top:16px;background:var(--olive-soft);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid #2e3a2e;}
    .right{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;}
    .info,.download{background:#141b16;border-radius:16px;padding:18px;border-left:6px solid var(--olive);border:1px solid #202822;}
    .info h3,.download h3{color:var(--olive-light);margin-bottom:8px;}
    .download{text-align:center;}
    .photo-box{margin-top:14px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #2a332b;background:#0f1411;}
    .photo-box img{width:100%;display:block;}
    @media (max-width:900px){.panel{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <header>
      <h1>Limpiador de Documentos</h1>
      <p>Sube tu archivo y recibe el documento limpio en segundos</p>
    </header>

    <section class="panel">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="upload-title">Subir Archivo</div>
        <div class="upload-sub">Formatos soportados: PDF, DOCX, TXT</div>

        <label class="btn" for="fileInput">Seleccionar Archivo</label>
        <input id="fileInput" type="file" />

        <div style="margin-top:14px;">
          <button class="btn btn-secondary">Adjuntar y Procesar</button>
        </div>

        <div class="status">
          Estado: Esperando archivo...
        </div>

        <div class="photo-box">
          <img src="imagenes/tu-foto-1.png" alt="Foto relacionada 1"/>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="right">
        <div class="info">
          <h3>¿Qué hace el sistema?</h3>
          <p>Elimina errores, limpia formato y entrega un documento optimizado para entregar o imprimir.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="photo-box">
          <img src="imagenes/tu-foto-2.png" alt="Foto relacionada 2"/>
        </div>

        <div class="download">
          <h3>Documento Limpio</h3>
          <p>Cuando termine el proceso, podrás descargarlo aquí.</p>
          <button class="btn">Descargar</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
